  "_readme": "Color themes for the Personal Finance Ledger. Edit a color or add a theme and reload the dashboard: no code changes needed. Every color is #rrggbb. Per theme: name; primary (main accent and chart color); dark (banner and deep shade); light (panel and card tint); canvas (page background); border; accent (second highlight); types (the Scheduled, Budget and Extra colors used by charts and the money-goes bar); kpi (the four stat-card colors: Income, Expenses, Left this period, Left after budgets); spectrum (six colors the charts and animated background run through); glow (optional, 0 to 1, how strong the animated background is); kpi_tuning (optional, blend/deepen/mute from 0 to 1, to make this theme's card colors calmer or livelier than the global setting). If this file has a mistake, the dashboard names the problem in the Appearance panel and keeps working.",
